      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holtwood_Dam"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The dam was originally built as McCalls Ferry Dam between 1905 and 1910 by the Pennsylvania Water & Power Company.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holtwood_Dam"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2015 Talen Energy sold the Holtwood plant to Brookfield Renewable Energy Partners to meet federal antitrust rules.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
