      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holtwood_Dam"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The plant generates 252 megawatts using 14 turbine‑driven generators.",
